This package drives a SearXNG instance (https://github.com/searxng/searxng,
AGPL-3.0) over HTTP and starts the upstream searxng/searxng Docker image. It
contains no SearXNG code. settings.yml is an override file merged over
SearXNG's defaults (use_default_settings: true), written for this project.
